# Website Audit — environment variables
# Only the variables this skill actually needs (see README + files/04-automation-spec.md).
# The CORE of this skill — scoring each of the 13 dimensions /10 with evidence quoted from the
# live site, and judging client-readiness — needs NO API keys. It is an act of evidenced human
# judgement. Keys below are ONLY for the optional automated collectors (fetch, screenshot, SERP).

PROJECT_ROOT=          # absolute path to the project root on this machine

# Optional — automated collectors. Omit any you do not use; the audit still runs by hand.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=     # optional — scoring assist + drafting the highest-priority content brief
SERPAPI_KEY=           # optional — competitor SERP / AI-Overview checks for D11 (AI Citation) and D13 (Market Position)
# Note: page fetching + full-page screenshots are done with the browser/headless Edge already on the
# machine (no key). Live-site evidence is captured by visiting the actual pages — never invented.
